==Assyrian Neo-Aramaic==

===Etymology===
{{aii-root|ܒ ܩ ܩ}}
Compare {{cog|akk|𒁀𒀝𒄣|ts=baqqu|t=gnat, numerous insects, swarm}} and {{cog|ar|بَقّ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|aii|[baːqaː]|a=Standard}}

===Noun===
{{aii-noun|ܒܵܩܵܐ|m|pl=ܒܵܩܹ̈ܐ,ܒܵܩ̈ܵܬ݂ܵܐ}}

# [[gnat]]
# {{lb|aii|collective}} [[gnats]]
#: {{uxa|aii|ܐܝܼܬ݂ ܣܲܓܝܼ '''ܒܵܩܵܐ''' ܐܵܟ݂ܵܐ|t=There’s a lot of '''gnats''' here.}}

==Classical Syriac==

===Etymology 1===
{{syc-rootbox|ܒ ܩ ܩ}}
From {{inh|syc|sem-pro|*baḳḳ-}}. Compare {{cog|akk|𒁀𒀝𒄣|ts=baqqu|t=gnat, numerous insects, swarm}} and {{cog|ar|بَقّ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|syc|[bɑqɑ]|aa=singular}}
* {{IPA|syc|[bɑqe]|aa=plural}}

====Noun====
{{syc-noun|m|ܒܩܐ|tr=bāqā|pltr=bāqē}}

# [[gnat]], [[mosquito]]

=====Inflection=====
{{syc-decl-noun-m|ܒܩ}}

===Etymology 2===
{{syc-rootbox|ܒ ܩ ܝ}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|syc|/bqɑʔ/}}

====Verb====
{{head|syc|verbs|tr=bqā}}

# to [[examine]], to [[consider]], to [[investigate]]

===References===
* {{R:CAL|bq}}
* {{R:CAL|bqy|V}}
* {{R:Costaz 1963|page=36a}}
* {{R:Payne Smith 1902|page=52b}}
* {{R:Sokoloff 2009|page=176b}}

{{topics|syc|Dipterans}}

==Turoyo==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tru|arc|בקא|tr=bāqā}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tru|/boqo/}}

===Noun===
{{tru-noun|ܒܳܩܳܐ|m}}

# [[mosquito]]

==Arabic==
{{ar-rootbox|ض ر ط}}

===Etymology 1.1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ṣ́araṭ-}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{ar-pr|ضَرَطَ,ضَرِطَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.nopass.vn:ضَرَط.ap:+++}}<br />
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.nopass.vn:ضَرْط,ضُرَاط.ap:+,ضَرُوط,ضَرَاط}}

# to [[fart]] [[audibly]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.nopass.vn:ضَرَط.ap:+++}}
{{ar-conj|I/a~i.nopass.vn:ضَرْط,ضُرَاط.ap:+,ضَرُوط,ضَرَاط}}

===Etymology 1.2===

====Pronunciation====
{{ar-pr|ضَرْط}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|ضَرْط|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|ضَرَطَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|ضَرْط}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Almaany}}

==Egyptian Arabic==
{{arz-root|ض ر ط}}

===Etymology===
{{ety|arz|:inh|ar:ضَرِطَ|text=+|tree=1}}

===Pronunciation===
{{rfp|arz}}

===Verb===
{{arz-verb|I|tr=ẓiriṭ|np=يضرط|nptr=yiẓraṭ}}

# to [[fart]] [[audibly]]
#: {{syn|arz|فسي|tr=fisi|t=to fart quietly}}

====Conjugation====
{{arz-conj/I-sound-ii-ia|ض|ر|ط|ẓ|r|ṭ}}

==Hijazi Arabic==
{{acw-root|ض ر ط}}

===Etymology===
{{ety|acw|:inh|ar:ضَرَط|text=+|tree=1}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|acw|/zˤar.ratˤ/}}

===Verb===
{{acw-verb|II|tr=ẓarraṭ|np=يضرّط|nptr=yiẓarriṭ}}

# to [[fart]] [[audibly]]
#: {{alti|acw|زرّط|tr=ẓarraṭ}}

====Conjugation====
{{acw-conj/II|ض|ر|ط|ẓ|r|ṭ}}

====Notes====
The roots ⟨ض ب ط⟩ and ⟨ض ر ط⟩ are the only roots where {{m|acw|ض}} is pronounced /zˤ/ instead of the standard /dˤ/.
